  "title": "高兴地跟你说哈，我们第三季度的活儿，进度比预想的要快。",
  "content_type": "paragraph",
  "content_text": "高兴地跟你说哈，我们第三季度的活儿，进度比预想的要快。\n[I'm pleased to report that we're ahead of schedule on the Q3 deliverables.]\n不过话说回来，集成测试那一段比预想的要久，搞得好慢，那可能要再加点人手。\n[That said, the integration testing phase is taking longer than expected, so we may need to allocate additional resources.]\n说句实话，我对这个第三方接口有点担心，只要那里一慢，后面肯定是一环扣一环的。\n[Honestly, I'm a bit concerned about the dependency on the third-party API — any delay there will cascade.]\n明天早早上碰个头，把进度再盘一盘，看是找上面还是要改范围。\n[Let's sync tomorrow morning to reassess the timeline and decide whether to escalate or adjust the scope.]",
