      "audio_rel_path": "/audio/20260615T003800Z___aa979a4d-88b2-4dd6-a511-a77383cde444_sicuan.wav",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "高兴地跟你说哈，我们第三季度的活儿，进度比预想的要快。",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 5.42,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm pleased to report that we're ahead of schedule on the Q3 deliverables.",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 5.42,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "不过话说回来，集成测试那一段比预想的要久，搞得好慢，那可能要再加点人手。",
          "start_time": 5.42,
          "end_time": 12.98,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "That said, the integration testing phase is taking longer than expected, so we may need to allocate additional resources.",
          "start_time": 5.42,
          "end_time": 12.98,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "说句实话，我对这个第三方接口有点担心，只要那里一慢，后面肯定是一环扣一环的。",
          "start_time": 12.98,
          "end_time": 21.380000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "Honestly, I'm a bit concerned about the dependency on the third-party API — any delay there will cascade.",
          "start_time": 12.98,
          "end_time": 21.380000000000003,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "明天早早上碰个头，把进度再盘一盘，看是找上面还是要改范围。",
          "start_time": 21.380000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's sync tomorrow morning to reassess the timeline and decide whether to escalate or adjust the scope.",
          "start_time": 21.380000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "end_time": 27.790000000000003,
          "language": "sicuan"
        }
      ]
